WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.960
You need five clear containers with tight lids, packing tape, and damp soil.

2
00:00:07.480 --> 00:00:10.680
Add an apple slice, a dry leaf, bread, and a bottle cap.

3
00:00:11.533 --> 00:00:12.733
An adult does the setup.

4
00:00:13.073 --> 00:00:15.533
Put damp soil and one item in the first four.

5
00:00:15.933 --> 00:00:17.793
The fifth gets apple and no soil.

6
00:00:18.253 --> 00:00:20.773
Then close and tape each lid all the way around.

7
00:00:21.583 --> 00:00:23.643
Look twice a week for three to four weeks.

8
00:00:24.203 --> 00:00:26.743
Bread often grows fuzzy mold within one to two weeks.

9
00:00:27.243 --> 00:00:28.503
Both apples usually rot.

10
00:00:29.317 --> 00:00:32.917
An adult seals every container, and nobody opens one.

11
00:00:33.737 --> 00:00:38.537
Mold spores can set off allergies and asthma, so anyone with asthma, a mold allergy,

12
00:00:38.817 --> 00:00:40.957
or a weakened immune system should not handle them.
